- content_for :title, "Privacy Policy — Sew Twirly"
- content_for :description, "Privacy policy for Sew Twirly."

.max-w-2xl.mx-auto.py-8
  h1.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.mb-4 Privacy Policy

  p.text-sm.text-gray-500.mb-8 Last updated: March 2026

  .space-y-8.text-gray-700
    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Information We Collect
      p We collect information you provide when creating an account, including your name, email address, and optional profile details such as a bio and social media links. When you use Sew Twirly, we also collect information about your activity, such as projects you like, creators you follow, and comments you leave.

    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 How We Use Your Information
      p.mb-2 We use your information to:
      ul.list-disc.pl-6.space-y-1
        li Provide and maintain the Sew Twirly platform
        li Display your public profile and projects to other users
        li Send you invitation and account-related emails
        li Improve our platform and user experience

    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Public Information
      p Your display name, bio, social links, published projects, likes, follows, and comments are visible to other users. Draft projects are only visible to you.

    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Cookies
      p We use essential cookies to keep you signed in and maintain your session. We do not use third-party tracking or advertising cookies.

    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Data Retention
      p We retain your account information for as long as your account is active. You may request deletion of your account and associated data by contacting us.

    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Third-Party Services
      p Project images are stored using our hosting provider. Gravatar is used to display profile avatars based on your email address. Product links in hotspots direct you to external retailer websites — those sites have their own privacy policies.

    div
      h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900.mb-3 Contact
      p
        | If you have questions about this privacy policy, please reach out through our
        '
        = link_to "Facebook community", "https://www.facebook.com/groups/sewtwirly/", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener noreferrer", class: "text-pink-600 hover:text-pink-800 font-medium"
        | .
